        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Tingsaeng Racguangc, Nang ngamv #^7 sin,",
            "Mwnpwang lev gaanchuangc ta;",
            "Nang khou kakwm kaganv maek ge,",
            "’Naamei, duhmei maek ge,",
            "Zaatc baihmei dih baihmei maek ge,",
            "Thaylou makpui mei maek;",
            "He muhzwng ling nunc thouc guang o,",
            "’Niw dic Nang khang sw khang.",
            "",
            "2. ’Chumhmei Racguangc, Science #^7 phu e,",
            "Lwmmei nunc #^7 bwan e,",
            "’Phumei nunc lung tiigaanclou o,",
            "Kandih kabamv ’thuic khou;",
            "’Khuaimei, ’pangmei, pingmei guay lev",
            "Tamzinghmei hac ganc o;",
            "Kauh ningting #^7 ’niw panty chaeng",
            "’Thanna tiigaanh mak saanv.",
            "",
            "3 How gaymei Racguangc, Nang ta lyan,",
            "Maansei thyamrav guay khou,",
            "Maansei latsaav, luswan guay khou,",
            "Lungning ’thanmei lung khou;",
            "How siimei ganh khang ’khavlou o,",
            "Nang ta how ’than ngam khang;",
            "Nyngswmei panty ramgai ta",
            "Meic guay how ngam kan diu.",
            "",
            "4 He ’twnmei lev zauzian Racguangc,",
            "Khrista #^7 lungc lyanmei",
            "Kapanty #^7 Nang ta lungc lyan,",
            "Nang ningmei taanclou e;",
            "Gaychamv p’ry hei katiulou o,",
            "Nang kumcna lungc lyan khang,",
            "Meic kathuic Khrista ta thay khang,",
            "Dih kathuic ta ngam khang."
          ]
        }
      },
